        "created_at": "2015-04-02T14:02:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>For the sake of petty argument is my 2nd favorite charitable cause.</p><p>It would not be a draw, it would be a win. &nbsp;Because thats how any other Villain character card being eaten by the wasteland would work. &nbsp;In this case nothing would tell you otherwise, so you win.</p><p>Then you write a fairy tale about little girls that dreamed big dreams and got eaten by wild creatures, as a warning to future generations to keep their dreams to themselves.</p>",
